Z||000000||bHooper||04-05-2001||10:03 PM||||maybe i'm just tired, or maybe it's just that i've had a bad week, or maybe mild mannered brian just feels like being a bit of an ass tonight.  but i've got a serious complaint.<P>look, i know it's a free world (well 3.xx billion of it anyway), but damn it if you come here and join the forum... don't come to use us like a cheap prostitute trying to pick up a john by flashing "your wears"!!  what i mean is, it bugs me when people show up with "flashy" add campaigns, trying to sell something on us... then leave!<P>i'm all for selling something, but this aint your daily fish wrap news paper... this is your neighborhood, your dorm room, or apartment complex.  this is your fraternity, your church (for some), the gym for others,the bar, and the school house for all!<P>therefore, if you want to come in and make a sell, spend some time here first... build a name for yourself, then say "hey i got a car to sell... anyone interested?!"<P>hoop steps off the bar... can i have another pint, please... bartender?<P>(btw, sorry for the spelling.. this spell checker doesnt like my OS)<P>hoop<p>[This message has been edited by bHooper (edited 04-05-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||jch82||04-05-2001||10:10 PM||||Well put hoop!<P>I always see these new names in The Mall trying to sell something and that is the last I ever hear of them......It does get annoying!<P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Yeah, my girlfriend takes collect calls from the road<BR>And it doesn't seem to matter that I'm lacking in the bulge<BR>She laughs at my dumb jokes when no one does<BR>She brings me mexican food from Sombrero's just because<BR>                 <I>-Blink 182</I>||||reg||14
